{% comment %}
  modules/accela_construct/queries/records/related/build

  Builds the request path for GET /v4/records/{recordId}/related.

  Params:
    object - Hash with `record_id` (see records/related.liquid)

  Returns object with `path` added.
{% endcomment %}

{% liquid
